    "html": "<div style=\"--color-void-base:#0e0918;--color-elevated-surface:#1a1624;--color-deep-panel:#1b1728;--color-muted-shell:#2c2834;--color-border-smoke:#3e3a46;--color-ash-text:#d1cece;--color-fog-text:#9d9797;--color-silver-rail:#e5e7eb;--color-cloud-white:#ffffff;--color-ember-cta:linear-gradient(30deg,rgb(253,137,37),rgb(255,12,0));--color-electric-current:linear-gradient(141deg,rgb(7,122,199),rgb(107,33,239));--font-geomanist:'DM Sans',sans-serif;background:var(--color-void-base);padding:48px 40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:32px;width:600px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-geomanist);\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:var(--font-geomanist);font-weight:300;font-size:48px;line-height:0.94;letter-spacing:-0.86px;color:var(--color-cloud-white);max-width:480px;\">AI agents and workflows<br><span style=\"color:var(--color-cloud-white);\">you can see and control</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:var(--font-geomanist);font-weight:400;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--color-ash-text);max-width:440px;\">Build visually, go deep with code, connect to anything. Every step of your agents' reasoning, traceable on the canvas.</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:12px;align-items:center;\"><a href=\"#\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:var(--color-ember-cta);color:var(--color-cloud-white);font-family:var(--font-geomanist);font-weight:400;font-size:15px;line-height:1;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;\">Get started for free</a><a href=\"#\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:transparent;color:var(--color-cloud-white);font-family:var(--font-geomanist);font-weight:400;font-size:15px;line-height:1;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--color-silver-rail);cursor:pointer;\">Talk to sales</a></div></div>",
    "name": "CTA Button Group",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
  },
  {
    "html": "<div style=\"--color-void-base:#0e0918;--color-elevated-surface:#1a1624;--color-deep-panel:#1b1728;--color-ash-text:#d1cece;--color-fog-text:#9d9797;--color-cloud-white:#ffffff;--color-ember-scorch:#ff492c;--font-geomanist:'DM Sans',sans-serif;background:var(--color-void-base);padding:48px 32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;width:600px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-geomanist);\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:12px;width:100%;\"><div style=\"flex:1;background:transparent;border-radius:24px;padding:20px 20px 22px;box-shadow:rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0px 0px 0px 1px inset,rgba(255,142,93,0.3) 0px 1px 0px 0px inset;display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1624,#2c1e3a);flex-shrink:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.477 2 12c0 4.42 2.865 8.17 6.839 9.49.5.092.682-.217.682-.482 0-.237-.008-.866-.013-1.7-2.782.603-3.369-1.342-3.369-1.342-.454-1.155-1.11-1.462-1.11-1.462-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.03 1.531 1.03.892 1.529 2.341 1.087 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.11-4.555-4.943 0-1.091.39-1.984 1.029-2.683-.103-.253-.446-1.27.098-2.647 0 0 .84-.269 2.75 1.025A9.578 9.578 0 0112 6.836c.85.004 1.705.114 2.504.336 1.909-1.294 2.747-1.025 2.747-1.025.546 1.377.202 2.394.1 2.647.64.699 1.028 1.592 1.028 2.683 0 3.842-2.339 4.687-4.566 4.935.359.309.678.919.678 1.852 0 1.336-.012 2.415-.012 2.743 0 .267.18.578.688.48C19.138 20.167 22 16.418 22 12c0-5.523-4.477-10-10-10z\" fill=\"#d1cece\"/></svg></div><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-family:var(--font-geomanist);font-weight:400;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--color-cloud-white);\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700;\">Top 50 Github.</strong> Our 183.4k stars place us among the most popular projects.</p></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;background:transparent;border-radius:24px;padding:20px 20px 22px;box-shadow:rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0px 0px 0px 1px inset,rgba(255,142,93,0.3) 0px 1px 0px 0px inset;display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1624,#2c1e3a);flex-shrink:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\" fill=\"#ff492c\"/></svg></div><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-family:var(--font-geomanist);font-weight:400;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--color-cloud-white);\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700;\">4.9/5 stars on G2.</strong> To quote \"I can move fast and never feel boxed in.\"</p></div></div></div><div style=\"width:100%;background:transparent;border-radius:24px;padding:20px 20px 22px;box-shadow:rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0px 0px 0px 1px inset,rgba(255,142,93,0.3) 0px 1px 0px 0px inset;display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;box-sizing:border-box;\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1624,#2c1e3a);flex-shrink:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#d1cece\"/><path d=\"M3 21v-2a4 4 0 014-4h4a4 4 0 014 4v2\" stroke=\"#d1cece\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"7\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#9d9797\"/><path d=\"M21 21v-2a3 3 0 00-3-3h-1\" stroke=\"#9d9797\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/></svg></div><div><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:var(--font-geomanist);font-weight:400;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--color-cloud-white);\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700;\">200k+ community members.</strong> This wouldn't be possible without you.</p></div></div></div>",
